01:06:25.450 --> 01:06:30.000
don't be absurd, my good man, if I go into a telephone booth and make a call, and the

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:34.660
I'm calling. He's not there. Well, I simply press button B and I get...

01:06:34.660 --> 01:06:36.750
Haven't you read our rules?

01:06:36.750 --> 01:06:41.750
Rules? Rules? But I'm not interested in your rules. I want my money back.

01:06:41.750 --> 01:06:44.750
