01:07:57.070 --> 01:07:58.960
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

01:08:00.120 --> 01:08:04.330
- Well? - I thought they might have seen something.

01:08:04.330 --> 01:08:08.940
- And if they did? - I thought they might like to help the police.

01:08:08.940 --> 01:08:12.360
I mean, guides, Anna. We're all girl guides, aren't we?

01:08:12.360 --> 01:08:17.850
Are we? Some of us may have aspired beyond that happy state, Miss Crawley.

01:08:17.850 --> 01:08:22.950
The girls are in bed and I'm certainly not going to disturb them in order to satisfy your morbid curiosity.

01:08:22.950 --> 01:08:26.210
- Yes, but I... - Will you kindly return to the sanatorium and attend to what concerns you?

01:08:26.210 --> 01:08:28.610
- But it does concern... - Yes, Miss Crawley.

01:08:32.270 --> 01:08:33.200
Nothing miswritten.

01:09:13.120 --> 01:09:18.790
know perfectly well that pets are not allowed in dormitories. And under the same rule, Mr. Harry,

01:09:18.890 --> 01:09:23.630
I doubt if you should be here either. Am I right in thinking that this animal here is Arab boy?

01:09:23.770 --> 01:09:24.830
Yes, Miss Fritton.

01:09:25.900 --> 01:09:30.000
Harry, now look me.

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:31.600
