01:09:31.600 --> 01:09:33.550
Have you had anything to do with this?

01:09:33.550 --> 01:09:36.360
- Me? - I do.

01:09:36.360 --> 01:09:38.050
I'm glad, Harry.

01:09:38.050 --> 01:09:41.370
Pinched him because she wanted her dad's horse to win.

01:09:41.370 --> 01:09:44.680
But we nipped in and swiped him from her, didn't we?

01:09:44.680 --> 01:09:46.240
- Yes! - Yes!

01:09:46.240 --> 01:09:48.540
Why didn't you take the animal back to the stables?

01:09:48.540 --> 01:09:50.140
Why bring him here?

01:09:50.140 --> 01:09:53.340
Because if we took him back now, they'd noddle him.

01:09:53.340 --> 01:09:55.760
What if the stable boys is in their pay?

01:09:55.760 --> 01:09:57.260
Then surely the most sensible thing

01:09:57.260 --> 01:09:58.490
would have been to a phone to police

01:09:58.490 --> 01:10:00.000
and tell them about that.

01:10:00.030 --> 01:10:04.330
I told him, you can't go dragging a reputable racehorse like him from pillar to post.

01:10:04.700 --> 01:10:05.560
Certainly not.

01:10:08.330 --> 01:10:10.110
How do you propose to get him back?

01:10:10.550 --> 01:10:13.790
Fatima's father arrives at London Airport at six in the morning.

01:10:14.130 --> 01:10:15.250
He's going to phone him.

01:10:15.660 --> 01:10:15.940
What?

01:10:16.480 --> 01:10:19.840
And tell him the horse is here and of half the school appearing in the juvenile courts?

01:10:20.220 --> 01:10:21.340
Oh, she's right, you know.

01:10:21.600 --> 01:10:23.300
We don't want our good name, Drag Fruit of Mud.

01:10:23.520 --> 01:10:24.440
Of course not.

01:10:24.680 --> 01:10:25.800
Now, there is only one thing to do.

01:10:25.800 --> 01:10:28.580
The animal must be taken out of here secretly at dawn.

01:10:29.080 --> 01:10:30.000
Fatima can ride it back.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:31.880
to the stables and say that she found

01:10:31.880 --> 01:10:33.680
him stringing. That's a wizard

01:10:33.680 --> 01:10:35.100
idea. Yes.

01:10:35.600 --> 01:10:37.820
Meanwhile, I shall telephone to the

01:10:37.820 --> 01:10:39.860
police, anonymously Harry, and tell them

01:10:39.860 --> 01:10:42.040
about that stable boy. Oh, what a dying

01:10:42.040 --> 01:10:43.980
way. Now set your alarms, girls,

01:10:44.100 --> 01:10:45.820
for six o'clock. Yes.

01:10:46.140 --> 01:10:48.000
And I want every girl

01:10:48.000 --> 01:10:50.160
here to promise on her guide's

01:10:50.160 --> 01:10:52.220
honor not to breathe a word

01:10:52.220 --> 01:10:53.720
about this. We are

01:10:53.720 --> 01:10:56.020
dismissed. Moreover, it's parents' day

01:10:56.020 --> 01:10:58.110
