01:10:58.110 --> 01:11:00.000
of evidence that the horse has been here

01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:06.150
removed now off to your beds at once girls as quickly as you can and remember

01:11:06.150 --> 01:11:11.990
that St. Trinian's expects that every fourth home girl tomorrow morning will do

01:11:11.990 --> 01:11:19.980
her duty good night girl good night good night good night good night good night

01:11:19.980 --> 01:11:23.750
Harry this way of course

01:11:51.720 --> 01:11:57.650
I'll bring you but something to tell you the fourth form got a horse in the dorm crazy see for yourself

01:11:57.650 --> 01:12:00.000
It's looking out the window think it's arable

01:12:00.030 --> 01:12:30.000
- Good boy.

01:12:30.160 --> 01:12:31.020
when things hot out.

01:12:31.870 --> 01:12:32.690
Well, how long will it be?

01:12:34.430 --> 01:12:36.650
Oh, you better warn the boys its parents day today, Pop.

01:12:36.690 --> 01:12:38.290
We can't have the police dragged into this.

01:12:39.310 --> 01:12:40.750
Okay, we'll hold the fort till then.

01:12:40.810 --> 01:12:41.150
So long.

01:13:01.660 --> 01:13:16.470
the door. Celeste, you go down and see if the coast is clear. We're going kids. Okay,

01:13:16.470 --> 01:13:30.000
it'll take a tank to get out of there. Ladies and gentlemen, we are faced with open rebellion.

01:13:30.700 --> 01:13:33.200
The sixth form have imprisoned the fourth form in their dormitory,

01:13:33.200 --> 01:13:35.000
