01:13:35.000 --> 01:13:37.200
- Not this Arab boy. - This Arab boy.

01:13:37.200 --> 01:13:40.600
And it is absolutely imperative that it runs today for all our sakes.

01:13:40.600 --> 01:13:43.200
- Our sakes? - Yes, you see, I have put the school funds on it.

01:13:43.200 --> 01:13:45.200
- What? - So if you want to correct your salaries,

01:13:45.200 --> 01:13:46.600
