01:13:46.600 --> 01:13:49.700
That's come to this, the jolly old stipend on a non-runner.

01:13:49.700 --> 01:13:52.000
I propose to storm the barricades.

01:13:52.000 --> 01:13:55.700
I'm sure that if we make one concerted charge, we shall carry the day.

01:13:55.700 --> 01:13:57.500
So come along, arm yourselves and follow me.

01:13:57.500 --> 01:13:59.160
There is not one moment to lose.

01:14:01.600 --> 01:14:03.840
I think the men should go first.

01:14:03.840 --> 01:14:05.860
They did last time when the bishop came, you remember?

01:14:05.860 --> 01:14:08.770
Oh, I say, look here, that must win.

01:14:08.770 --> 01:14:12.280
I say, shall we out of frightful war cries?

01:14:12.280 --> 01:14:13.940
Well, that, I feel, is optional.

01:14:13.940 --> 01:14:16.840
But remember Napoleon's precept that the essence of attack

01:14:16.840 --> 01:14:18.100
