01:15:07.800 --> 01:15:13.200
Miss Crawley, do you still wish to question the girls about that racehorse?

01:15:13.200 --> 01:15:14.200
Well, I only thought...

01:15:14.200 --> 01:15:19.200
It's the sixth form you want, Miss Crawley. Then upstairs now. Go quickly, quickly.

01:15:19.200 --> 01:15:21.440
Perhaps I should.

01:15:21.440 --> 01:15:29.730
Believe me, you should. Collect her in 30 seconds. Who's that?

01:15:30.890 --> 01:15:43.780
Harry, the parents are ready.

01:15:44.160 --> 01:15:46.000
We can't possibly let them see us like this.

01:15:46.380 --> 01:15:49.160
Miss Buckland, get the Brownies campfire going at once.

01:15:49.200 --> 01:15:50.140
Yes, Miss Britton.

01:15:50.390 --> 01:15:56.420
