01:16:12.720 --> 01:16:15.280
Put her in my bathroom and lock the door.

01:16:15.420 --> 01:16:16.000
Lock the door?

01:16:16.100 --> 01:16:19.060
Yes, Miss Crawley is a police officer in disguise.

01:16:19.700 --> 01:16:21.000
By George, we're for it now.

01:16:21.140 --> 01:16:22.780
