01:16:28.230 --> 01:16:30.000
Keep the parents at bay until the rest of us get clean.

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:32.740
OK, Larry. And I feel sure that if we keep our heads,

01:16:32.740 --> 01:16:35.400
