01:17:14.840 --> 01:17:18.760
In a way.

01:17:18.760 --> 01:17:25.640
Never bargained for this sort of Cape of Woodley.

01:17:25.640 --> 01:17:26.530
No.

01:17:31.310 --> 01:17:36.960
Here, them people outside. They ain't parents.

01:17:36.960 --> 01:17:41.040
Your brother's with them. He's out there with a mob of his oppo's.

01:17:41.040 --> 01:17:42.580
What on earth is he doing here?

01:17:42.580 --> 01:17:44.910
Search me.

01:17:44.910 --> 01:17:50.560
Good morning, Millicent. I'd like a few words with you.

01:17:50.560 --> 01:17:55.190
And I'd like more than a few with you.

01:17:55.190 --> 01:17:58.100
Leave us, Harry. I wish to speak with my brother alone.

01:18:00.090 --> 01:18:04.600
Oh, you have the audacity, Clarence, to show your face in here today.

01:18:04.920 --> 01:18:07.440
After all that you've done to me, I do not know.

01:18:08.020 --> 01:18:10.860
