01:18:32.850 --> 01:18:36.330
If e'er a boy gets there and wins this afternoon,

01:18:36.330 --> 01:18:40.680
I am concerned with the reputation of my school.

01:18:40.680 --> 01:18:42.960
I shall never, never forgive you, Clarence,

01:18:42.960 --> 01:18:45.800
