01:27:00.030 --> 01:27:00.670
the next fence.

01:27:02.070 --> 01:27:05.190
There are three horses out in front, Mordonia, Blue Prince, and Arab Boy.

01:27:05.440 --> 01:27:06.260
Nothing else in it.

01:27:06.300 --> 01:27:07.880
It looks to me like a three-horse race.

01:27:09.180 --> 01:27:10.480
Now, Mordonia's falling back.

01:27:10.890 --> 01:27:15.070
Blue Prince is moving into first place, followed by Arab Boy as they come round the bend into

01:27:15.070 --> 01:27:15.830
the home stretch.

01:27:16.720 --> 01:27:19.580
They're heading for home now, and it's Arab Boy shying away.

01:27:20.060 --> 01:27:22.640
Blue Prince is drawing level again as they come up to the last fence.

01:27:22.920 --> 01:27:23.960
They jump that neck and neck.

01:27:24.260 --> 01:27:25.550
There are only two horses in it now.

01:27:25.890 --> 01:27:28.390
Arab Boy's taking the lead with only 50 hours to go.

01:27:28.390 --> 01:27:30.000
It's Arab Boy from Blue Prince.

01:27:30.730 --> 01:27:32.990
Atta, boys, one, the children of Gold Club.

01:27:35.820 --> 01:27:38.400
After this, I shouldn't dream about it staying here, not at all.

01:27:38.400 --> 01:27:40.680
I should think not after what we've witnessed today.

01:27:40.900 --> 01:27:42.860
I was horrified, quite horrified.

01:27:42.860 --> 01:27:43.740
You must be ashamed of yourself.

01:27:43.740 --> 01:27:45.760
I shudder when I think of what poor Mona has suffered.

01:27:47.290 --> 01:27:49.190
It's one! Atta, boys!

01:27:49.310 --> 01:27:49.930
It's one!

01:27:50.670 --> 01:27:51.570
Really, Harry?

01:27:52.650 --> 01:27:54.630
Oh, in that case, ladies and gentlemen,

01:27:55.090 --> 01:27:58.580
courtesy forbids me to tell you exactly where you can send your daughters.

01:27:59.220 --> 01:28:00.000
Will you excuse me?

01:28:02.520 --> 01:28:06.610
Come with me, Harry. I think we have an appointment with Mr. Amalthier.

01:28:06.610 --> 01:28:08.960
Yeah, no river air for him this year, I...

01:28:13.820 --> 01:28:30.000
I was more than delighted to accept your headmistress's invitation to come here tonight to present...

01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:36.510
your annual awards but for the resource of your fourth form I should not have won

01:28:36.510 --> 01:28:44.390
the race today. It is therefore with the greatest pleasure that I begin these

01:28:44.390 --> 01:28:51.760
proceedings by presenting this cup for good conduct which I understand has not

01:28:51.760 --> 01:28:58.700
been presented since 1927 to Jacqueline West.

01:29:23.770 --> 01:29:30.000
The Arnold of the School has suffered enough for one day and don't imagine for one moment that I don't know who did it.

01:29:30.000 --> 01:29:35.380
the occasion, I am going to appeal to your sporting instincts to return that gun. And

01:29:35.380 --> 01:29:40.240
in order that the girls may suffer no ignominy, I'm going to have the lights put out for 30

01:29:40.240 --> 01:29:52.560
seconds in order to allow them to return it unseen. Right, Miss Wilson? Right-ho!

01:29:52.560 --> 01:29:55.380
Miss Wilson, lights me!

01:30:00.280 --> 01:30:02.180
Two boats!
